  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EaP Network 2024-2026</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">EaP Network 2024-2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">EaP N&#xe4;tverket arbetar f&#xf6;r st&#xe4;rkt samarbete mellan svenska civilsamh&#xe4;llesorganisationer  och civilsamh&#xe4;llesorganisationer i &#xd6;straparternskapsregionen med syfte att fr&#xe4;mja demokratisk utveckling, pluralistiska samh&#xe4;llen och samarbete med EU.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The EaP Network works for strengthened cooperation between Swedish civil society organizations and civil society organizations in the Eastern Partnership region with the aim of promoting democratic development, pluralistic societies and cooperation with the EU.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the intervention is to:

Ensure the sustainability and local ownership of the EaP Network by fostering strategic partnership and enhancing its capacity to support collaboration, advocacy, and the advancement of human rights, democracy, and sustainable development beyond the phase-out period.</narrative>
  </description>
